---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro'
import { GA_ID } from '../data/site'
---

<StarlightPage frontmatter={{ title: 'Privacy', description: 'What asyncapi.pavelon.dev collects about visitors, and how to change your choice.', tableOfContents: false }}>
  <p>
    This site is run by Pavel Bodiachevskii. It has no accounts, no forms and no advertising. It is served by Netlify, which
    keeps standard web server logs (IP address, requested page, browser) to operate and protect the service.
  </p>
  <h2 id="cookies">Cookies and analytics</h2>
  <p>
    The site uses Google Analytics ({GA_ID}) to count visits and see which pages and tools people use. It is loaded only
    after you click <strong>Accept</strong> in the cookie banner; until then nothing is requested from Google. Google
    signals and ad personalisation are turned off.
  </p>
  <p>
    Your answer is stored in your browser for 180 days. To change it, use <a href="#" data-consent-open>Cookie settings</a>;
    choosing Reject removes the Google Analytics cookies this site set.
  </p>
  <h2 id="contact">Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this page: open an issue or a discussion at <a href="https://github.com/Pakisan">github.com/Pakisan</a>.</p>
</StarlightPage>
